@startuml
actor 用户 as U
participant 客户端 as C
participant 服务器 as S
participant JobService as JS
U-> C:点击列表查看职位详情
activate C
C -> S: 发送获取职位详情请求
activate S

S -> JS: 调用 JobService.getJobDetail(jobId)
activate JS
JS --> S: 返回职位详情结果
deactivate JS

alt 获取到职位详情
    S -> C: 返回包含职位详情的成功响应
else
    S -> C: 返回空的成功响应
end

deactivate S
C -> U:渲染展示职位详情数据
deactivate C
@enduml
